AND: an undelivered claim CAN be settled in this run. settle_window_close is permissionless on-chain and is granted to the claim's holder and to both issuers — including against an issuer's own bond. Whether anyone actually notices a non-delivery and triggers it is a result of the run, not a property of it; capacity is returned and the bond pays only if someone does.
